 are Invited to\nBuild for Real-World Impact\nmboun Botlco\nabilities at INDUX 5.0-2026. Transform ideas into intelligent solutions, build impactful prototypes, and take\n6 nnmo\nyour innovation from concept to real-world application.\n691 mot{noitiansi\nset2aa\nEligibility & Team Formation\nB.Tech/B.E./BCA/M.Tech/MCA, Diploma, and othertechnical programs (all disciplines)\nTeam size: 3 to 4 members (with 1 faculty mentor-optional but encouraged)\nInterdisciplinary teams encouraged\nRegistration Fee: 2,500 per team (Payable after shortlisting by the Online Interview Committee)\nKey Highlights\nIndustry Exposure-Solve real challenges shared by industries\nHands-on Prototyping- Ideate, build, test & refine your solution\nExpert Mentorship-Guidance fromindustry professionals & academicians\nAttractive Rewards-Cash prizes, prototype grants & incubation support\nGlobalExposure-Connect withinnovators beyond conventionalboundaries\nRecognition-Certificates, digital showcases & media features\nImpact Showcase-Present yourinnovation before an expert jury\nStartup Pathways-Connect with incubators & industry scout\nCareer Opportunities-Internship & industry opportunities\nINDUX 5.0 Roadmap\nStage\nDescription\nDate\nStage 1\nParticipant Registration (Online)-No Participation Fee\n14 Sept. to 1 October 2026\nStage 2\nSubmission ofAbstract, PPT & 3-minute Video Pitch (Online)\nTill 2 October 2026\nStage 3\nOnline Interview with Jury-Industry +Academia\n8–9 October 2026\nStage 4\nSelection Announcement & Registration Fee Payment\n10–20 October 2026\nStage 5\nOn-site 24-Hour Hackathon to Build, Refine & Present Prototype\n2–3 November 2026\nSCAN TO\nContact Us\nREGISTER\nProf. Aishwarya Singh\nCo-ordinator, Indux 5.0, 2026\nVikrant University, Gwalior (MP)\nMobile: +91 79874 59533\nProf. Narrotam Dutt Upadhyay: +91 9907059984\nProf. Madhwan Upadhyay: +91 9630036698\nWebsite: https://vikrantuniversity.ac.in/indux 5.0 2026/\nEmail: indux5.0 hackathon@vikrantuniversity.ac.in\n\"From 